Joven — third-party software bundled with the downloadable app
==============================================================

Joven itself is MIT-licensed; see LICENSE in the repository root.

The packaged app (Joven.exe / Joven.app / the Linux build) ships one external
tool so that a reader does not have to install it by hand. It is redistributed
under a permissive licence that requires attribution, which is what this file
provides. It is not modified in any way — it is the official release artefact,
downloaded at build time by packaging/fetch_vendor.py.

Installing Joven from PyPI (`pip install joven-ebook-annotator`) does not bundle it;
this file applies only to the packaged app.

epubcheck was bundled up to v1.0.0b7 and is not redistributed any more, so its
attribution has been removed along with it.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
kepubify — https://github.com/pgaskin/kepubify
Converts the finished EPUB into Kobo's KEPUB flavour.
Bundled at: vendor/kepubify (vendor/kepubify.exe on Windows)
